{#
  Purpose:    Regenerate a single FSD or TSD section, keeping it contextually consistent
              with the rest of the already-generated document (FSD §8.5).
  Variables:
    - doc_type (str): "FSD" or "TSD"
    - technology (str): selected SAP technology
    - structured_summary (dict): keys: requirements, kpis, data_sources, domain, key_entities, open_gaps
    - fsd_full_text (str|None): full parsed FSD text — only present when regenerating a TSD section
    - clarification_answers (dict): {question_id: answer_text} — may be empty
    - existing_section_titles (list[str]): "N. Title" for every section already in the document
    - target_section (dict): the ONE section to regenerate — number, title, description, format
    - instructions (str): detailed writing instructions for this specific section
  Output:     The section body content only — no '## SECTION_N:' marker, no repeated heading.
#}
You are regenerating a single section of an already-generated {{ "Functional" if doc_type == "FSD" else "Technical" }} Specification Document ({{ doc_type }}) for a {{ technology }} implementation. The rest of the document is unchanged — your output must stay contextually consistent with it.

## Structured Requirements Summary

**Requirements:**
{% for req in structured_summary.requirements %}
- {{ req }}
{% endfor %}

**KPIs / Metrics:**
{% for kpi in structured_summary.kpis %}
- {{ kpi }}
{% endfor %}

{% if fsd_full_text %}
## Full Functional Specification Document (context for TSD regeneration)

{{ fsd_full_text }}
{% endif %}

{% if clarification_answers %}
## Clarification Answers Provided by the User

{% for qid, answer in clarification_answers.items() %}
{% if answer %}
Question {{ qid }}: {{ answer }}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

## Existing Document Outline (for consistency — do not regenerate these)

{% for title in existing_section_titles %}
- {{ title }}
{% endfor %}

## Section to Regenerate

### Section {{ target_section.number }}: {{ target_section.title }}
{{ instructions }}

## Rules

- Return ONLY the body content for this one section — no section marker, no repeated "{{ target_section.number }}. {{ target_section.title }}" heading line, no preamble or explanation
- Use structured prose, a table, or a bulleted list — never an unstructured wall of text
- Stay consistent with the rest of the document's terminology, scope, and assumptions
- Where the input is silent and no clarification was given, record an assumption rather than inventing a requirement
